			"notes": {
				"rationale": "Bescheid wissen 'be informed' (Duden Bescheid) is a Collocation: wissen only supports the noun, as in er weiß Bescheid über die Pläne, so weiß and Bescheid form one Locution VERB (de/funktionsverbgefuege-are-collocations). The expression governs über for its free complement, so über joins as a member though it stands apart and is no part of the Lemma (de/governed-preposition-joins-its-governor, de/fixed-member-test)."
			}
		},
